WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.110
<b>Sniper</b>

3
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:12.340
<b>Sniper</b>

4
00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:31.150
What the hell is he doing over there?

5
00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:34.220
C'mon just humor the poor guy.

6
00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.620
He has too much pride to
show his face to the crew,

7
00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:37.890
but he still wants
to rescue his friend.

8
00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:44.960
Well long as he
stops singing, I guess.

9
00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:45.500
[FRANKY]
Hey!

10
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.760
Get over here!

11
00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:49.070
[SOGEKING]
Oh, sure.

12
00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:53.380
<b>Ramen Kenpo</b>

13
00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.350
Let's start the meeting for
"Operation Rescue Robin."

14
00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.130
We've never met before.

15
00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.690
Don't you two have any questions about me?

16
00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:05.030
So the car you were
in was car number 6.

17
00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.030
That means that we've got five more left.

18
00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:09.440
Y'know, like
"where's Sniper Island?"

19
00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:11.770
[SANJI]
But we don't know which one of those Robin
is in.

20
00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.040
[SOGEKING]
The answer is:
It's in your heart.

21
00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.910
And by the way are you strong?

22
00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.420
Are you kidding,
I'm super strong!

23
00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.250
Even stronger than usual this week!

24
00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:26.460
Remember, the point is to rescue Robin,
not beat the enemy.

25
00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.730
'Least in theory.

26
00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:29.260
[SANJI]
We're up against
a lot of Marines,

27
00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.120
in a narrow space

28
00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.650
so we gotta make sure
we don't get surrounded.

29
00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.900
We should avoid as
many fights as we can,

30
00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:37.850
and whittle down the
main force in turns.

31
00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:40.490
Here we go, listen up.

32
00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.430
[NAMI]
Okay!

33
00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.240
Now I'm ready for battle!

34
00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.600
Hm? What's going on?

35
00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.840
[PAULIE]
Don't you play innocent with me,
immoral girl!

36
00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.370
Have you no shame,
changing your clothes

37
00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.780
out here in front of everyone?!

38
00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.680
[TILESTONE ET AL.]
– Shame is overrated.
– Shame is overrated.

39
00:02:58.650 --> 00:02:59.950
What was I supposed to do?

40
00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:01.920
The train only has one car!

41
00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.220
Cover up your legs!

42
00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.550
Cover up your stomach!

43
00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.660
That goes for you too,
Square-Head-Sisters!

44
00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.220
People like you are corrupting society!

45
00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.630
[KIWI]
Whatever, you're just too shy.

46
00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.200
[MOZU]
Shy boy!

47
00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.160
Why, you!

48
00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:18.030
[LUFFY]
Stupid black shorts with their stupid tiny
pockets!

49
00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:21.200
Come on get in there!

50
00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.270
Don't put meat in your pants, you idiot!

51
00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:27.680
I'm starting to think you
might actually pull this off!

52
00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:30.250
You certainly seem
riled up, if nothing else!

53
00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.480
You bet we are!

54
00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.510
Those jerks got away
with Robin last time,

55
00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.880
but now that
I know what's going on,

56
00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:36.570
they don't stand a chance!

57
00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:37.820
[NAMI]
I hope you're right!

58
00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.540
'Cause if you get stuck
in something again,

59
00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.270
you're gonna have hell to pay!

60
00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:42.770
Nah, don't worry,

61
00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:45.510
I got a reason to beat
them this time around!

62
00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.430
Uh, right.

63
00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.510
Hey.

64
00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.970
Did you change
your weapon, Nami?

65
00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:50.640
Hm?

66
00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:51.780
Oh, no.

67
00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.940
It's pretty much the same one as before.

68
00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.670
Usopp just improved
it with some dials

69
00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.760
after we got back from Skypeia.

70
00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.050
This is the Perfect Clima Takt.

71
00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:01.570
I see.

72
00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.840
So that's his...

73
00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.470
Right.

74
00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.500
It's Usopp's...

75
00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:05.900
Uh...

76
00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.210
Last work...

77
00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.810
Don't get all sad now!

78
00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.030
You ready?

79
00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:25.250
Let's do this.

80
00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.330
An intruder?

81
00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:29.820
[CORGY]
Uh, yes, sir.

82
00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.890
That's what I heard.

83
00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:35.420
[LUCCI]
It's not feasible to board the
Puffing Tom while it's running.

84
00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.080
If there really is
an intruder that means

85
00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.970
we let him sneak on
board before we departed.

86
00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.720
What an embarrassment.

87
00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.060
[CORGY]
I agree, sir.
It's inexcusable.

88
00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.860
But if you can't get on

89
00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.470
while the train is moving,
you can't get off, either.

90
00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.910
That means the intruder as well

91
00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.700
as the missing prisoners
are still here somewhere.

92
00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.640
[LUCCI]
You just have to find them.

93
00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.820
[CORGY]
Yes, sir!

94
00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:06.450
<b>Car Seven</b>

95
00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.420
[MARINE]
Captain T-Bone.

96
00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:18.290
I don't think there's any room for someone
to hide in here.

97
00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:25.350
[ALL THREE]
– Good evening!
– Good evening!

98
00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.090
[MARINES]
– It's them!
– It's them!

99
00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.360
[MARINE]
They were right outside!

100
00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.160
We found 3 suspicious men,

101
00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:33.330
including the
criminals in car 7!

102
00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:37.160
Corner and capture them!

103
00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.000
Ever use a hammer before?

104
00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.270
'Cause you sure do suck.

105
00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.310
[SOGEKING]
Sh-Shut up!

106
00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.460
[MARINE]
There's no point in resisting!

107
00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:44.740
[OFFICIAL]
Open the door already!

108
00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.860
They're gonna break through!

109
00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:50.000
[SOGEKING]
I know!

110
00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.080
[MARINE]
This way!

111
00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.990
They found the
intruder in car #7!

112
00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.410
[OFFICIAL]
The criminals, too?

113
00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.110
[MARINE]
Yeah.

114
00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:56.430
Let the guys in car 3 know.

115
00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.870
That Franky guy's
a lot of trouble.

116
00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.670
Move in and capture them alive!

117
00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.750
Move it! Stand back!

118
00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:06.320
[SOGEKING]
Whoa!

119
00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:07.120
They're shooting at us!

120
00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:08.460
Then hurry it up!

121
00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.200
A little help would be nice!

122
00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.240
[gunshot]

123
00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.320
Don't shoot blindly!

124
00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:18.700
[OFFICIAL]
We don't want these guys dead!

125
00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.770
You're right.

126
00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.740
What do we do, Captain T-Bone?

127
00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.240
Allow me to handle this.

128
00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.790
I hate crooked men and crooked swordplay.

129
00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:36.920
Here comes my Right-Angle Flash!

130
00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.010
Bone Soir!

131
00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.060
They're gone!

132
00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.720
The roof?

133
00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.800
They're at the end of the train!

134
00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.070
[SANJI]
Now! Hurry!

135
00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.940
[T-BONE]
Oh no.

136
00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.920
Everyone get back to the front cars right
now!

137
00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.630
This is a trap!

138
00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:28.060
What are you talking about?

139
00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:28.830
[MARINE]
What the?!

140
00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.700
Quick! Retreat-they tricked us!

141
00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.080
[OFFICIAL]
Huh?!

142
00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.310
We can't go back anymore.

143
00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.680
The door is blocked.

144
00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:35.910
No way.

145
00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.720
The cars are detached!

146
00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.980
[EVERYONE]
– What?!
– What?!

147
00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:43.810
[MARINE]
Damn it!

148
00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:45.110
That's cheating!

149
00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.410
[OFFICIAL]
You'll pay for this!

150
00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.470
[commotion among MARINES]

151
00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.500
I was too late.

152
00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.300
[SANJI]
Have a safe trip, gentlemen!

153
00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.900
Say hello to the Sea Kings for me!

154
00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.570
[SOGEKING]
Fair thee well!

155
00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.710
That's two cars down!

156
00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:04.610
Should cut the small fries
down by about 50 or so.

157
00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.350
But aren't Luffy and the others coming on
the same railway?

158
00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.880
What happens when the cars run into each
other?

159
00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.550
[SANJI]
Eh, they'll come
up with something.

160
00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.300
[OFFICIAL]
You arrogant thugs.

161
00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.000
I'm gonna tear this door down and you with
it!

162
00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:20.880
[SANJI]
Oh?

163
00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.450
Going for a swim?

164
00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:29.480
All right five to go!

165
00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:30.580
[OFFICIAL]
You bastard.

166
00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:32.150
You're gonna suffer for that one!

167
00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.700
What will poor
Captain T-Bone do?!

168
00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.500
Hey!

169
00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.710
Report this to CP9!

170
00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.980
Great, more of these guys.

171
00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.380
And Frites Assorties!

172
00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:53.290
Sniper King Gunpowder Star!

173
00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:58.460
Strong Right!

174
00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:03.400
Huh?

175
00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.970
Heavy weight shot fire!

176
00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:08.010
[gunshot]

177
00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.490
[SOGEKING]
Whoa! They hit him!

178
00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.370
That hurt.

179
00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.070
[OFFICIAL]
Keep shooting!

180
00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:24.120
[gunshot]

181
00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:29.780
Why isn't the gun
working on him?!

182
00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.230
[SANJI]
Whoa, that was crazy.
What the hell are you?!

183
00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.700
[FRANKY]
Huh?

184
00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.840
Oh guess I forgot to
tell you, I'm a cyborg.

185
00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.170
[SOGEKING]
Those are real?!

186
00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.110
Yep.

187
00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.180
I got steel and weapons built right into
my body.

188
00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:55.880
It still kinda
hurts if I get shot

189
00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.080
and I might bleed a little, too.

190
00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:59.970
But no big deal.

191
00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:02.040
Just when you think
you've seen it all!

192
00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.620
The world's a crazy place.

193
00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.130
Awesome!

194
00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:07.430
Poke.

195
00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.360
Auuughhh!

196
00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.500
What in the hell was that for?!

197
00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:12.500
Huh?

198
00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:13.990
You can deflect bullets, but needles hurt?

199
00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:15.590
For one, I'm not
your science experiment,

200
00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:16.920
so stop poking me!

201
00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.390
And for two, just so you know,

202
00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.980
my back isn't the
same as my front!

203
00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.080
Get it?

204
00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.420
I had to do the
operation on myself,

205
00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.420
so I couldn't reach
around behind me.

206
00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.590
In other words, only
the front side is cyborg!

207
00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.440
[FRANKY]
While I'm at it, lemme tell
you another little secret.

208
00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.240
My belly is always cold.

209
00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.780
Can you guess why?

210
00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:35.810
[SOGEKING]
How would I know?

211
00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.110
[FRANKY]
It's 'cause I got
my own personal fridge

212
00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:40.080
in there to keep my cola cool!

213
00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.480
Wow, that's handy!

214
00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:43.980
[SOGEKING]
Man, that's gotta be great in the summer!

215
00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.880
[SANJI]
Okay, the cola
thing is really neat,

216
00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.280
but we don't have time for this!

217
00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:50.320
We gotta get moving
to the next car!

218
00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.520
This one is number 4.

219
00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:56.130
<b>Car Four</b>

220
00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:56.020
[door opening and closing]

221
00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:58.860
[SOGEKING]
Hm?

222
00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:04.730
<b>Wanze
Fighting Cook, CP7</b>

223
00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:05.940
I'm Wanze!

224
00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.630
It's a mad, mad, mad, mad, world

225
00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:10.300
and I'm a mad, mad,
mad, mad, Wanze!

226
00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:16.150
Here I come!

227
00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:22.560
What's up you guys?

228
00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:23.520
Are you hungry?

229
00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:24.250
You look hungry.

230
00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.320
How 'bout some ramen?

231
00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:26.820
I'm the head
steward of this train

232
00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:29.090
so I can cook anything you
fellas would like to eat.

233
00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.470
Okay, ramen it is,

234
00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.840
but before I start,
a little trivia for you.

235
00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.840
My nose hairs're
shaped like this!

236
00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:36.740
They crisscross inside

237
00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.710
so they look just like
fishnet stockings.

238
00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.950
This is very important!

239
00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:43.010
First I grab the flour.

240
00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:48.890
And knead it in
my mouth like this.

241
00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.780
Done! Here!

242
00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.620
[SANJI ET AL.]
– Hell, no!
– Hell, no!

243
00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.820
Okay, that was a waste of time.

244
00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.860
Listen we've got someone
waiting on us, Wanze.

245
00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:09.130
You'll have to enjoy that nose ramen on
your own.

246
00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.660
[WANZE]
Not so fast!

247
00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.800
If you wanna pass
through this car,

248
00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:15.090
you'll have to defeat me first!

249
00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.810
[SANJI]
You think you can stop us?

250
00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:24.080
[WANZE]
I know I can!

251
00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.850
Go, go, go!

252
00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.150
This is an important
escort mission

253
00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:32.420
so they got an important guy
like me to keep the train safe!

254
00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.200
If you wanna rescue
that friend of yours

255
00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:39.070
then first you'll have
to defeat my Ramen Kenpo!

256
00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.570
[SOGEKING]
Ra-Ramen Kenpo?

257
00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.780
Ra-Ramen Kenpooooo?

258
00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:47.730
That little turd is making fun of me!

259
00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:50.000
I know he's annoying, but you gotta keep
your cool!

260
00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:51.860
[WANZE]
How'd you like my
idiot imitation,

261
00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.670
was it dumb enough for you?

262
00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.210
[SANJI]
Don't let him get to you!

263
00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.180
[WANZE]
Go, go, go, go!

264
00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.950
This dude got ants in his pants or what?

265
00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:10.490
I swear that I grazed him
with one of those shots.

266
00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.790
But he doesn't even care!

267
00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.790
He even looks happy!

268
00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.030
I thought my heart was
gonna leap outta my chest!

269
00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.390
How was I supposed
to know you make

270
00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.310
that same stupid face
for everything!

271
00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:21.880
[BOTH]
– I'll take this guy down, just watch.
– I'll take this guy down, just watch.

272
00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:23.220
[SANJI]
Hold on.

273
00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.480
You can't let this clown get under your
skin.

274
00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:29.080
We got more important things to
do than sit here and play games.

275
00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.950
You stay back and
I'll make quick work of him.

276
00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:35.080
I don't know what your deal is,
but if you were a real chef,

277
00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.180
you'd conduct yourself
with a little more dignity.

278
00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.630
I'm talking to you, stupid!

279
00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.450
Why don't you take your own
advice for once?!

280
00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:47.770
[SOGEKING]
Look!

281
00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.690
He dodged that kick without even blinking!

282
00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:54.530
In fact, he even looks happy!

283
00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.060
I thought I was gonna die!

284
00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.600
Stop making that damn face!

285
00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:00.060
Don't do the same joke twice!

286
00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.110
[train whistle]

287
00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.380
[SANJI]
I've had enough.

288
00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.000
Like I said, this guy is mine.

289
00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:15.950
You go ahead.

290
00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:18.560
I'll catch up with you two later.

291
00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.150
[KALIFA]
So you're saying the rear
two cars were detached?

292
00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:26.120
How could you allow something like this to
happen?

293
00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.220
[OFFICIAL]
My deepest apologies,
ma'am but in our defense,

294
00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.960
even Captain T-Bone got
trapped in one of those cars,

295
00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.840
and you know how powerful he is!

296
00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:33.910
Fine.

297
00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.010
Give me a status report on what's left of
the train.

298
00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:36.980
Yes, ma'am!

299
00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:38.780
As of now, in addition
to the engine room,

300
00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.650
there are five cars
still with us.

301
00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:43.850
All of the military in the fifth car have
been taken out.

302
00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:47.350
That leaves Wanze
guarding the fourth car.

303
00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:49.490
Nero on duty in the third car.

304
00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.820
Nico Robin up in the first car.

305
00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:55.370
And everyone here
in the second car.

306
00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.340
[LUCCI]
It seems our enemy is not to be taken
lightly.

307
00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.350
However, the only
problem that concerns me

308
00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.450
in our current situation is that

309
00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:05.690
Franky is walking
around this train free.

310
00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:08.290
Our mission was to take
Franky and Nico Robin

311
00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:12.290
into custody and then deliver
them securely to Enies Lobby.

312
00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.660
As long as we accomplish that,

313
00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:15.830
I don't care how
many men we lose

314
00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:18.370
or how we take care
of our enemies.

315
00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.640
That has no bearing on our mission.

316
00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:23.510
And were you able to identify the
intruders?

317
00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:24.610
Yes!

318
00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:26.410
First, there are the two men
that we had in custody

319
00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.180
but now it seem
that one of those two

320
00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.080
is wearing some sort
of strange mask.

321
00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.450
There's also a
blond guy in a suit

322
00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.650
that we've never seen before,

323
00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.620
making a total of
three intruders!

324
00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.530
[KAKU]
He's probably a member
of the Straw Hat pirates,

325
00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.590
just like that
long-nosed man is.

326
00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:44.100
Naturally, their purpose here is to rescue
Nico Robin.

327
00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.400
And, since they freed him,

328
00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:48.400
Franky's decided
to help them out.

329
00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:50.370
Hey Lucci, would
you like me to go

330
00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:52.570
and keep an eye on Nico Robin?

331
00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.110
That's not necessary.

332
00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.310
Just stay focused on recapturing Franky.

333
00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.740
Nothing else matters here.

334
00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:02.340
So, they want to take Nico Robin back,
do they?

335
00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:07.230
Sorry to break it to them but
that's just not gonna happen.

336
00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:13.080
I won't let you pass through!

337
00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:16.370
Kneading the high quality flour.

338
00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.790
[SOGEKING]
Is he gonna bring out
the ramen noodles again?

339
00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.470
Ramen Beam!

340
00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:26.300
[FRANKY]
Those are sharp!

341
00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.880
Damn it!

342
00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.420
[WANZE]
Cut it out!

343
00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.900
[FRANKY]
Let's head over on the roof.

344
00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:44.760
[SOGEKING]
Uh, right!

345
00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.990
We'll leave it to you then,
Sanji! Best of luck!

346
00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.400
[WANZE]
Go, go, go, go, go!

347
00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.540
They're go-go-go-go gone!

348
00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.940
But I suppose
that's no big deal.

349
00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:57.410
'Cause the person
waiting for them

350
00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:59.370
in the next car is
one tough customer!

351
00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.270
Nero!

352
00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:02.040
He's the latest addition to CP9!

353
00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.880
An assassin for justice!

354
00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.280
Those two are dead meat!

355
00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:08.150
If there's one thing that Nero loves to
do, it's kill!

356
00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:10.880
Go, go, go, go!

357
00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.680
Flanchet...

358
00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.290
...Shoot!

359
00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:20.840
I told you, I'm in a hurry here.

360
00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.310
Okay then!

361
00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.010
Fine!

362
00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:25.620
Ramen Kenpo: Noodle Slicer!

363
00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:33.150
Fire Skate Blades!

364
00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:48.030
Not only did you disrespect
my beautiful attack,

365
00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:51.830
you kicked me
ten times, didn't you?!

366
00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.840
[SANJI]
Actually, it was twelve times.

367
00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.070
Hey, you!

368
00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:58.010
Are you secretly super strong or
something?

369
00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.220
It's not really a secret.

370
00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:01.120
Maybe you're just super weak.

371
00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.290
[WANZE]
Super weak?!

372
00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:05.430
Not even my old man would say something
like that to me!

373
00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:06.490
How dare you!

374
00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:07.290
I'm Wanze!

375
00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:09.530
I won't let you get away with this!

376
00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:10.730
Rude!

377
00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:13.500
Besides, I was simply distracted by your
swirling eyebrows.

378
00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:14.610
They make me dizzy!

379
00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:15.740
That's why I fell for your attack.

380
00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:18.620
Still, you're a good fighter!
Too bad you look weird!

381
00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:19.690
Hey, you freak!

382
00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:23.070
You're in no position to
call anyone weird looking!

383
00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.670
After that failed attack, I feel
like I need to prove myself!

384
00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:31.000
So I'm gonna show
you something amazing!

385
00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:34.640
This is why I was chosen to escort those
criminals!

386
00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:49.650
Ramen Kenpo: Secret Technique!
Ramen Kenpo: Secret Technique!

387
00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:54.160
Beat the dough, pull the dough!
Beat the dough, pull the dough!

388
00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.160
What the hell is all that?

389
00:18:57.180 --> 00:19:01.150
It's my incredible,
edible, combat uniform!

390
00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.960
Ramen's Formal Suit!

391
00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.690
Nooow fight!

392
00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.190
Go, go, go, goooo!

393
00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:11.190
Go! The secret of this
Ramen Kenpo technique

394
00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.500
is controlling the free
moving noodles at will!

395
00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.500
See?

396
00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:16.600
Bastard.

397
00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:19.740
How dare you disgrace
food like that, you wierdo!

398
00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:23.600
My speed, my power,
and my special abilities.

399
00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:27.020
I'm at a different level
now in all of those areas!

400
00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:32.320
If showing you isn't enough,
I'm gonna beat it into you!

401
00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:34.690
Go!

402
00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:38.730
[SANJI]
Just shut up already
and get on with it!

403
00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.700
But prepare yourself,
'cause I'm gonna make you

404
00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:43.700
eat every last one
of those noodles.

405
00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:49.860
Question.

406
00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.760
Who are you and what
are you doing up here?

407
00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:58.010
<b>Nero "the Sea Weasel"
CP9</b>

408
00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:58.070
[NERO]
The officer in charge of the third car.

409
00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:01.600
A Four Powers master
and a new recruit in CP9.

410
00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:04.840
The sea weasel, Nero.

411
00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.070
Unfortunately.

412
00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:09.770
I'm under specific
orders not to kill you.

413
00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.130
You know, you being one of

414
00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:14.830
our most important
criminals and all.

415
00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:15.670
All right.

416
00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:16.990
That's one half.

417
00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.970
Now tell me what you're doing up
here on the roof of this train!

418
00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:22.390
If you had just waited inside,
I would've come to you!

419
00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:24.320
Well, how was I supposed to know that?

420
00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.620
You may have tried to cheat and skip right
past this car.

421
00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.130
[FRANKY]
My, my, my!

422
00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.000
That's rather cautious of you!

423
00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:33.030
But in your line of work,

424
00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:36.220
you always gotta keep
your guard up, right?

425
00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:40.190
By the way, what's that weird looking
thing there behind you?

426
00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.500
That was a dirty trick!

427
00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:56.040
Of course it was!

428
00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:57.040
They don't call me

429
00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.380
the King of Water Seven's
Underworld for nothing!

430
00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.430
[SOGEKING]
Don't let me down, octo shoes.

431
00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:20.440
[knocking]

432
00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:25.310
Long Nose?! Is that you?

433
00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:31.090
Why are you here?!
